      "cooked": "<p>“But next week will be worse” Haven’t even started the episode and we’re already off to a good start. :V</p>\n<p>Darn, I was hoping there would actually be art of Valentine.</p>\n<p>Oh boy, Wraith anti-emotional manipulation pills! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>You can tell he’s a villain because he drinks wine out of a tumbler.</p>\n<p>Damn, don’t call me out like that, guys. :V</p>\n<p>So, who can name all the villains on the cover?</p>",
