      "created_at": "2023-02-07T22:13:15.022Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The reveal that Valentine did all this <em>without powers</em> is just so cool! I already liked him as a villain, but the idea that he’s now at this point where he can just manipulate people at such a high level makes him fascinating to me. And the idea that other people will dismiss his victories as a cheat is just delicious. He’s so completely unfulfilled!</p>",
