    {
      "id": 250655,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-02-08T21:43:38.264Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m as much of a Sentinels geek as anyone, but I didn’t recognize all the names they rapid-fired at us.  Some of them were from the Wraith Rogues Gallery episode, but I don’t think all of them were?  Surprisingly, I do know a good number of the ones on the cover, and can guess a few more.</p>\n<p>Let’s see if we can hivemind them out.  Here’s the ones I can suss out, left to right by row:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Row 1: Hangman, Skeleton Key, (mohawk guy), Mr. Hideous</li>\n<li>Row 2: The Operative, Adhesivist, Revenant, (looks like a welding mask)</li>\n<li>Row 3: Crossword, Spite</li>\n<li>Row 4: Ermine, (guy with scar, goatee, and glasses), The Chairman, Mayor Overbrook</li>\n<li>Row 5: The Entertainer, Valentine, (demon), The Hippo</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I figure The Jellyfish, Doctor Rubber, Saw Man, and Labyrinth could be among them, but not sure who.  Sawyers don’t normally wear welding masks, but it is construction-themed. I guess this is before Heartbreaker.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-02-09T21:44:30.533Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
