      "created_at": "2026-01-21T17:27:38.621Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Stealing is wrong, Bru…er, Maia!</p>\n<p>On the pictured villains, I’m assuming Top Hat Monocle Mustachios Man is The Entertainer, though that seems a rather dated look for him.  I wonder who the heck the devil horns guy is though.  I have no idea how MW got Revenant from the tiny fragment of a face visible behind Wraith’s cape.  Also interesting that Spite is pictured when they emphatically stated he wouldn’t be in this.</p>",
